+# Version numbering scheme
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use calendar versioning (CalVer) for version numbers. The decision was stated by the project owner as "For versioning, we're using calver". No specific CalVer format (for example YYYY.MM.MICRO) has been recorded, so none is prescribed here.
